From f7f1dec1fc7e1e929ef1cb1694d85024ca43d638 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DCS <claude@dcs.io>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 00:43:27 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] search: leave out people

excludePersonIds on metadata, smart, random and statistics search leaves
out assets showing any of those people. In the search filters, clicking a
selected person again leaves them out.
